   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "3.  PROFILE — per field: value, confidence, method (DTMF | LEXICON | REGEX | LLM), asr_engine, confirmed_at.\n     raw_transcript is ERASED AT CONFIRM — a Postgres CHECK makes keeping it impossible. The audio was already gone.\n     “We keep neither the voice nor the words, only the confirmed answer.”",
   "originalText": "3.  PROFILE — per field: value, confidence, method (DTMF | LEXICON | REGEX | LLM), asr_engine, confirmed_at.\n     raw_transcript is ERASED AT CONFIRM — a Postgres CHECK makes keeping it impossible. The audio was already gone.\n     “We keep neither the voice nor the words, only the confirmed answer.”",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "c4",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": false
