   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Back down the SAME channel she arrived on.\n\n· Top 3 qualifications she is actually ELIGIBLE for\n· 1 NEAR-MISS with the exact gap — “one more year”, or\n  “do the Level 2 course first”.  THIS IS R4's FOURTH OUTPUT\n· One plain sentence of reason each. No scheme jargon\n· PM-DAKSH hand-off + ₹1,500/month stipend where it applies\n· ₹50,000 asset grant (needs a bank loan) where it applies\n· What to do on Monday, and the nearest centre\n· Repeatable on demand — call back and press 9",
   "originalText": "Back down the SAME channel she arrived on.\n\n· Top 3 qualifications she is actually ELIGIBLE for\n· 1 NEAR-MISS with the exact gap — “one more year”, or\n  “do the Level 2 course first”.  THIS IS R4's FOURTH OUTPUT\n· One plain sentence of reason each. No scheme jargon\n· PM-DAKSH hand-off + ₹1,500/month stipend where it applies\n· ₹50,000 asset grant (needs a bank loan) where it applies\n· What to do on Monday, and the nearest centre\n· Repeatable on demand — call back and press 9",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
