   "text": "· Verified beneficiary register\n· Consent register — every row carries the\n  script_version she actually heard\n· Financial-literacy module flag, compulsory\n  in every course (Ch.3 ¶7A.a.iv)\n· ₹50,000 asset-grant eligibility flag,\n  conditional on a bank loan",
