   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "outcome: RECOMMENDED → ENROLLED →\nCERTIFIED → PLACED → DROPPED\n\nUpdated from the mobiliser's call list,\nNOT from a new officer screen.\n\nGuidelines mandate 70% placement.\nCAG measured PMKVY at 41%.\n\nTurns “demand” into “demand AND delivery”,\nwhich is what a DL-PACC argues about.",
   "originalText": "outcome: RECOMMENDED → ENROLLED →\nCERTIFIED → PLACED → DROPPED\n\nUpdated from the mobiliser's call list,\nNOT from a new officer screen.\n\nGuidelines mandate 70% placement.\nCAG measured PMKVY at 41%.\n\nTurns “demand” into “demand AND delivery”,\nwhich is what a DL-PACC argues about.",
