   "text": "Batch export, convergence-shaped:\n“240 people in this block want and are\n eligible for QP AGR/Q1201”\n\n→ SSDM · DSC · NSFDC / NSKFDC\n→ training partners\n\nPlus PM-DAKSH routing counts.\nPer-district, per-project, per-beneficiary.",
