   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "MEASURE SPREAD, NOT JUST RELEVANCE.\n\nCAG: 40% of all certifications in 10 job-roles.\n90.35% of “Green Jobs” in Safai Karmchari alone.\n\nIf our recommendations concentrate the same\nway, we have automated the failure with\nbetter UX. So the ranker carries a spread\npenalty and the console plots the\ndistribution against that line.",
   "originalText": "MEASURE SPREAD, NOT JUST RELEVANCE.\n\nCAG: 40% of all certifications in 10 job-roles.\n90.35% of “Green Jobs” in Safai Karmchari alone.\n\nIf our recommendations concentrate the same\nway, we have automated the failure with\nbetter UX. So the ranker carries a spread\npenalty and the console plots the\ndistribution against that line.",
